<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank details M3 developments in March.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank details M3 developments in March.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank published the following data relating to M3 money supply in March.</p>
<p>AGGREGATE (in bln marks)	  Mar97  Feb97  Mar96 EndMar</p>
<p>								     Level</p>
<p>1) BANK LENDING TO DOMESTIC</p>
<p>   NON-BANKS (total)	     +37.4  +33.1  +33.1   4,863.8</p>
<p>   Lending by Bundesbank	 +-0.0  +-0.0  +-0.0	8.7</p>
<p>   Lending by banks		+37.4  +33.1  +33.1   4,855.2</p>
<p>    To firms and individuals   +23.2  +23.5  +28.5   3,664.3</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     short term lending	  + 6.7   +4.5   +7.8    608.1</p>
<p>    To public authorities	+14.1  + 9.6   +4.6   1,190.9</p>
<p>2) NET EXTERNAL ASSETS</p>
<p>OF CREDIT INSTITUTIONS</p>
<p>   AND THE BUNDESBANK	    -26.1  -10.8  -10.9    268.8</p>
<p>3) MONETARY CAPITAL FORMATION</p>
<p>   FROM DOMESTIC SOURCES, TOTAL+ 7.6  +17.0  + 6.2   2,799.2</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>Time deposits</p>
<p>     4 yrs and more		 +4.2   +5.0   +4.2   810.9</p>
<p>Savings deposits over 3 mths</p>
<p>   notice, savings certificates +0.5   -1.7   -3.1   498.5</p>
<p>Bank debt securities</p>
<p>     in circulation		 +1.8  +11.1   +1.1  1,149.3</p>
<p>4) DEPOSITS OF FED. GOVT.</p>
<p>   IN BANKING SYSTEM		+0.2   -0.1   +0.6     0.3</p>
<p>5) OTHER FACTORS		    +8.8   +3.4  +16.0   197.2</p>
<p>6) MONEY STOCK M3		  -5.2   + 1.8  - 0.6  2,135.9</p>
<p> Currency in circulation	 +2.2    +1.1   +3.2   246.3</p>
<p>    Sight deposits		 -1.8    -1.4   -3.2   602.3</p>
<p>    Time deposits up to 4 yrs  -7.4    -4.8   -9.5   399.9</p>
<p>Savings deposits at</p>
<p>     three months notice	 +1.8    +6.9   +8.9   887.3</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED DATA</p>
<p> Annual change from Q4 1996(%) +8.3    +9.1    -    2,132.5</p>
<p>Money M3, monthly average</p>
<p>Annual change over past</p>
<p>six months (%)</p>
<p>   M3 aggregate		    +7.9    +7.7    -	-</p>
<p>   M2 aggregate		    +5.9    +5.2    -    1,261.5</p>
<p>   M1 aggregate		   +12.5   +11.0    -     865.5</p>
<p>   M3 extended			-	+6.9    -	-</p>
<p>Lending to firms</p>
<p>    and individuals		+8.3    +8.2    -    3,659.7</p>
<p>   Monetary capital formation  +4.3    +5.0    -    2,794.8</p>
